Changes:
 mx-updater (26.11.01mx25) mx; urgency=medium
 .
   * polkit: allow basic and full upgrades from remote sessions (RDP,
     X2Go, VNC, SSH) after admin authentication. allow_any was "no", so
     pkexec refused without a password prompt and the upgrade terminal
     closed right away.
   * debian/control: add dh-python to Build-Depends.
   * Translations refresh.
Original-Maintainer: Kent Mathern <maintainer@mepiscommunity.org>
